      "extract": "The preceding discussion is based on $SL_q(2)$. One may, however, describe the knots by $SU_q(2)$ instead of by $SL_q(2)$ if one sets \\be \\begin{array}{rcl} \\bar a &=& d \\\\ \\bar b &=& -qc \\end{array} \\ee Then the $SU_q(2)$ algebra is \\be \\left. \\begin{array}{l} ab=qba \\\\ a\\bar b=q\\bar ba \\end{array} \\right. \\quad \\left. \\begin{array}{l} a\\bar a+b\\bar b=1 \\\\ \\bar aa+q_1^2\\bar bb=1 \\end{array} \\right. \\quad b\\bar",
