      "extract": "We have so far viewed the preons only as a simple way to describe the algebraic structure of the knot polynomials. If these preons are in fact physical particles, the following decay modes of the quarks are possible \\[ \\begin{array}{llll} {\\rm down~quarks:} & {\\cal{D}}^{3/2}_{\\frac{3}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}} \\longrightarrow {\\cal{D}}^{1/2}_{\\frac{1}{2}\\frac{1}{2}} + {\\cal{D}}^1_{1-1} & & ab^2 \\longrightarrow a+b^2 \\\\ & &",
